hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24261","Muhammad ibn Humayd Abu Sufyan narrated to us, from Ma'mar, from al-Zuhri, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Abdillah ibn Ka'b, from Ka'b, who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: The soul of the believer clings in the trees of Paradise until Allah returns it to its body."
